c-programming-topic-3-m3-q8.explanation:
Explanation: 
Step 1: Calls from main() 
f1(); 
f2(2); 
f3(); 
So activation starts as: 
main → f1, f2, f3 
Step 2: Expand f2(2) 
int f2(int x) 
{ 
    f3(); 
    if (x == 1) 
        return f1(); 
    else 
        return (x * f2(x - 1)); 
} 
For f2(2): 
Calls f3() Since x ≠ 1, calls f2(1)  
For f2(1):Calls f3()  
Since x == 1, calls f1()

